[PrintTextModified Text:マーゴ！！|#0201Adv09_Hiro024| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:――血しぶきが周辺に飛び散り、<br>通路はひどい有様と化した。|#0201Adv09_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

